    "body": "In case everyone isn't aware you can still run this and other x86_64 builds by starting Terminal using Rosetta.\r\n\r\n1. Find `Terminal.app` in Applications\r\n2. Right click and `Get Info`\r\n3. Click `Open using Rosetta`\r\n\r\nRelaunch terminal and everything will work like it did yesterday 👍🏼 ",
